<title>CANADA: Canada Sept new motor vehicle sales rise 1.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada Sept new motor vehicle sales rise 1.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>New motor vehicle sales rose 1.1 percent seasonally adjusted in September to 98,778 units from a revised 97,699 units in August, Statistics Canada said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A Reuters survey of economists had forecast a 2.6 percent rise in September.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745</p>
</text>
